    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "La fourrure sur sa tête s’est endurcie et a pris la forme d’un casque en fer. Il est de nature très bagarreuse.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "What appears to be an iron helmet is actually hardened hair. This Pokémon lives for the thrill of battle.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "頭の　体毛が　硬質化して 鉄の　ヘルメットのように　なった。 とても　好戦的な　性質。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il s’est tant adonné au combat qu’il a évolué : il est désormais doté de griffes redoutables qui prennent la forme de dagues en s’allongeant.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "After many battles, it evolved dangerous claws that come together to form daggers when extended.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "戦いに　明け暮れて　進化した 結果　伸ばすと　短剣に　変わる 物騒な　ツメを　手に入れた。",
